      "extract": "There is a large literature of partonic energy loss calculations in various frameworks that make different assumptions [59–65] as well as many phenomenological implementations of these energy loss calculations that have been applied to small systems [31, 33, 34, 66–70]. We use our pQCD-based en- ergy loss model that is described in detail in our previous work [44], briefly recapping the main features here. Partons",
      "extractCut": true
