      "extract": "Figure 2 plots Rπ0 AA from nPDFs only and from our energy loss model as a function of pT for 3He+3He, 4He+4He, and 6Li+6Li collisions, respectively. Comparing these figures, we see that the nPDF-only pre- diction for 4He + 4He has both the central value lower and the uncertainty band larger than that of 3He + 3He and 6Li + 6Li. This reflects the specialized parameteri- zation for 3He and 6Li in EPPS21 [45], which",
