      "extract": "We have shown that our pQCD-based energy loss model leads to an approximate linear depen- dence of the nuclear modification factor on the cube root of the geometric average of the atomic mass numbers in- volved in the collision, i.e. RAB ∝( √ AB)1/3. We see good experimental agreement with this trend from the measured RAA for symmetric Pb+Pb, Xe+Xe, Ne+Ne, and O + O; however, we see a striking disagreement with the",
